d my ups and downs\\nAnd my share of great sins\\nBut I\'ve never drawn blood\\nAnd I\'ve never been in jail\\n\\nI get along quite well\\nWith most everyone\\nI\'m glad that I\'m alive\\nAnd I thank God I\'m able\\nTo see the sunshine\\nAnd smell the roses up close\\n\'Cause life\'s a beautiful thing\\nAnd don\'t ever let anyone tell you different\\nEven when times get rough\\nAnd people get ugly\\nAnd your soul\'s at stake\\nJust remember to keep your head up\\nKeep your heart strong\\nYou\'ll be all right\\n\\n[Chorus]\\nIt\'s my life\\nAnd it\'s now or never\\nI ain\'t gonna live forever\\nI just want to live while I\'m alive\\nIt\'s my life\\nAnd there\'s no other\\nI wanna live it my way\\n\\nI\'ve been to hell and back\\nFought the devil winning\\nScars to prove the battle real\\nBut won\'t be losing\\nIt ain\'t all fun and games\\nWhen you\'re playing with the big boys\\nLife\'s real games\\nAin\'t for the faint of heart\\nBut I\'ve been through so much\\nAnd I\'ve seen the worst of it\\nSo bring it on\\nBecause I\'ve seen worse\\n\\nI\'m gonna live my life\\nThe way I want to\\nAnd if things get tough\\nI\'m tough enough to take it\\nYou can bend but don\'t break\\nJust keep your head up\\nAnd keep telling","generation_id":"cceebdb7-5d69-46b7-abbf-223a7e97034d","chat_history":[{"role":"USER","message":"Channel #GPT3: The user: oxagast said: Franklin: what are the lyrics to my way by limp bizkit. "},{"role":"CHATBOT","message":"Starting Franklin..."},{"role":"USER","message":"oxagast asked: what are the lyrics to my way by limp bizkit"},{"role":"CHATBOT","message":"The lyrics to My Way by Limp Bizkit are: \\n\\nI did it my way, yeah\\nJust like Frank would sing\\nI took the long road\\nAnd the fate that came with it\\nI\'ve had my ups and downs\\nAnd my share of great sins\\nBut I\'ve never drawn blood\\nAnd I\'ve never been in jail\\n\\nI get along quite well\\nWith most everyone\\nI\'m glad that I\'m alive\\nAnd I thank God I\'m able\\nTo see the sunshine\