ial data breaches or malicious manipulation of the data. Personal data, opinions, and preferences could be exploited, which may seriously impact the safety and well-being of individuals and communities if used maliciously.  \\n\\nWhile these risks are serious, it\'s important to note that the responsible development and use of AI can provide many benefits to society. Finding the right balance between human and AI decision-making will likely be a key challenge going forward."}],"finish_reason":"COMPLETE","token_count":{"prompt_tokens":435,"response_tokens":347,"total_tokens":782,"billed_tokens":766},"meta":{"api_version":{"version":"1"},"billed_units":{"input_tokens":419,"output_tokens":347}}}','_max_body_size' => undef,'_request' => bless( {'_method' => 'POST','_uri_canonical' => bless( do{\(my $o = 'https://api.cohere.ai/v1/chat')}, 'URI::https' ),'_headers' => bless( {'user-agent' => 'libwww-perl/6.68','x-client-name' => 'Franklin','accept' => 'application/json','::std_case' => {'x-client-name' => 'X-Client-Name','if-ssl-cert-subject' => 'If-SSL-Cert-Subject'},'content-length' => 1800,'authorization' => 'bearer jsIgap1Q************************2au0dV3Y','content-type' => 'application/json'}, 'HTTP::Headers' ),'_max_body_size' => undef,'_uri' => $VAR1->{'_request'}{'_uri_canonical'},'_content' => '{"chat_history": [ {"role": "USER", "message": "Channel #2600: The user: CerebraNet said: Franklin: Why are people being conditioned to  be addicted to AI. "},{"role": "CHATBOT", "message": "That is a strong statement, and while I cannot determine the extent to which humans will or wont suffer, it is possible that an over-reliance on any technology could have negative consequences.   There are a few ways in which humans could potentially struggle if they become too dependent on AI:   - Data Privacy: As AI often requires large amounts of personal data to learn and adapt, use"} ], "message": "CerebraNet asked: Outsourcing ones thinking to AI is bad for human safety", "preamb