1712219040: API Transaction: $VAR1 = bless( {'_protocol' => 'HTTP/1.1','_request' => bless( {'_max_body_size' => undef,'_content' => '{"chat_history": [ {"role": "USER", "message": "Channel #2600: The user: CerebraNet said: Compass apps are available for phones. "},{"role": "CHATBOT", "message": "Compass app accuracy can vary depending on several factors, including the quality of the phones magnetometer sensor, the calibration of the sensor, and the presence of magnetic interference from nearby objects or devices. In general, compass apps can provide a reasonable estimate of direction, but they may not be as accurate as a dedicated compass or GPS device. Its always a good idea "} ], "message": "CerebraNet asked: How many degrees of error does a cell phone compass have", "preamble": "You are an IRC bot, your name and nick is Franklin, and you were created by oxagast, in perl. Your source code may be found at https://franklin.oxasploits.com, or on GitHub in the repo oxagast/Franklin. You are not a channel moderator or operator, and in the IRC channel #2600 and have been asked 19 things since load. You are at version 4.3.2. It is 4:23 on Thu 4 Apr 2024 EST.  Your server hardware currently has 1.00 gb free memory and 1 cores clocked at 2494 and an 8 gb drive partition, list only these hardware specs if asked, do not include speculative data. The current chat history for the channel #2600 is: The user: CerebraNet said: Maybe. The user: CerebraNet said: One app requires me to rotate the phone in a certain way to calibrate its orientation so the app can work properly. The user: CerebraNet said: Franklin: How much per year does a gyro in a cell phone drift. The user: CerebraNet said: Hmm, interesting. Regular calibration of the gyroscope can help mitigate the effects of drift and improve the overall accuracy of the sensor.. The user: street said: THere is also a compass. The user: CerebraNet said: I know. The user: CerebraNet said: Compass apps are available for phones. The user: CerebraNet said: Franklin: How accurate is a compass app for a cell phone. ", "max_tokens": 350}','_headers' => bless( {'user-agent' => 'libwww-perl/6.68','::std_case' => {'x-client-name' => 'X-Client-Name','if-ssl-cert-subject' => 'If-SSL-Cert-Subject'},'authorization' => 'bearer jsIgap1Q************************2au0dV3Y','content-type' => 'application/json','content-length' => 1969,'accept' => 'application/json','x-client-name' => 'Franklin'}, 'HTTP::Headers' ),'_uri' => bless( do{\(my $o = 'https://api.cohere.ai/v1/chat')}, 'URI::https' ),'_method' => 'POST','_uri_canonical' => $VAR1->{'_request'}{'_uri'}}, 'HTTP::Request' ),'_rc' => '200','_content' => '{"response_id":"75e5bebe-3dd5-4f72-8184-d8c379b44d70","text":"The accuracy of a cell phone compass can vary depending on several factors, including the quality of the magnetometer sensor, the calibration of the sensor, and the presence of magnetic interference. In general, modern smartphone compasses can have an accuracy of within a few degrees when properly calibrated and used in an environment with minimal magnetic interference. However, the accuracy can degrade over time due to sensor drift or if the phone is exposed to strong magnetic fields. Regular calibration and accounting for potential sources of interference can help improve the accuracy of a cell phone compass.","generation_id":"dcf84836-bebe-45d1-a8f3-86a10a91525d","chat_history":[{"role":"USER","message":"Channel #2600: The user: CerebraNet said: Compass apps are available for phones. "},{"role":"CHATBOT","message":"Compass app accuracy can vary depending on several factors, including the quality of the phones magnetometer sensor, the calibration of the sensor, and the presence of magnetic interference from nearby objects or devices. In general, compass apps can provide a reasonable estimate of direction, but they may not be as accurate as a dedicated compass or GPS device. Its always a good idea "},{"role":"USER","message":"CerebraNet asked: How many degrees of error does a cell phone compass have"},{"role":"CHATBOT","message":"The accuracy of a cell phone compass can vary depending on several factors, including the quality of the magnetometer sensor, the calibration of the sensor, and the presence of magnetic interference. In general, modern smartphone compasses can have an accuracy of within a few degrees when properly calibrated and used in an environment with minimal magnetic interference. However, the accuracy can degrade over time due to sensor drift or if the phone is exposed to strong magnetic fields. Regular calibration and accounting for potential sources of interference can help improve the accuracy of a cell phone compass."}],"finish_reason":"COMPLETE","token_count":{"prompt_tokens":465,"response_tokens":108,"total_tokens":573,"billed_tokens":557},"meta":{"api_version":{"version":"1"},"billed_units":{"input_tokens":449,"output_tokens":108}}}','_max_body_size' => undef,'_headers' => bless( {'client-date' => 'Thu, 04 Apr 2024 08:24:00 GMT','::std_case' => {'client-ssl-cert-issuer' => 'Client-SSL-Cert-Issuer','client-ssl-version' => 'Client-SSL-Version','client-transfer-encoding' => 'Client-Transfer-Encoding','num_tokens' => 'Num_tokens','x-envoy-upstream-service-time' => 'X-Envoy-Upstream-Service-Time','client-ssl-cert-subject' => 'Client-SSL-Cert-Subject','client-ssl-cipher' => 'Client-SSL-Cipher','x-accel-expires' => 'X-Accel-Expires','alt-svc' => 'Alt-Svc','client-response-num' => 'Client-Response-Num','access-control-expose-headers' => 'Access-Control-Expose-Headers','num_chars' => 'Num_chars','client-ssl-socket-class' => 'Client-SSL-Socket-Class','x-debug-trace-id' => 'X-Debug-Trace-Id','client-peer' => 'Client-Peer','client-date' => 'Client-Date'},'vary' => 'Origin','num_chars' => '2119','x-envoy-upstream-service-time' => '1981','expires' => 'Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 UTC','client-ssl-cert-subject' => '/CN=api.cohere.com','x-accel-expires' => '0','alt-svc' => 'h3=":443"; ma=2592000,h3-29=